{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/schema.json",
  "meta": {
    "name": "Kinet UI/UX Design Tokens",
    "source": "Kinet-s-r-o/ACS frontend (frontend/src/index.css, components, lib)",
    "extracted": "2026-11-13",
    "notes": [
      "Colors are stored as RGB triplets to match the source implementation (consumed as rgb(var(--token)) in CSS).",
      "Hex values are provided for tooling convenience; the triplet form is authoritative.",
      "Semantic naming is used throughout; technology-specific names are avoided.",
      "Values marked 'probable' in the ambiguity report are included but flagged in 'status'.",
      "2026-11-13 update: source defects D-1 (undefined --primary/--surface), D-2 (chart theme adaptation), and D-3 (hardcoded UI hex) were resolved. Chart theming is now token-driven via lib/chartTheme.ts; new tokens --text-on-action, --warning-strong, --shadow-color, --highlight-color added.",
      "2026-11-13 update: D-5 (table text scoping), D-6 (light-mode Tailwind remaps), and D-7 (native control theming) were resolved. A shared table-text class defines table value typography; table color rules are scoped to direct data-table cells; light-only utility remaps were replaced by a Tailwind 4 @theme inline semantic mapping; native checkboxes/radios/ranges inherit the theme accent. D-4 (dual confirmation: password vs 2FA) is intentional and will not be unified."
    ]
  },
  "semanticUtilities": {
    "description": "Tailwind 4 @theme inline mapping: semantic utilities resolve to CSS tokens in both themes, including opacity and state variants (e.g. text-success-text, bg-error/10, border-accent/30, hover:bg-hover). Palette-shade utilities (text-slate-400, bg-zinc-700, ...) are prohibited and rejected by the UI gate.",
    "mapping": {
      "accent": "rgb(var(--accent))",
      "action-primary": "rgb(var(--action-primary))",
      "success": "rgb(var(--success))",
      "success-text": "rgb(var(--success-text))",
      "error": "rgb(var(--error))",
      "error-text": "rgb(var(--error-text))",
      "warning": "rgb(var(--warning))",
      "warning-text": "rgb(var(--warning-text))",
      "warning-strong": "rgb(var(--warning-strong))",
      "neutral": "rgb(var(--border-default))",
      "base": "rgb(var(--bg-base))",
      "surface": "rgb(var(--bg-surface))",
      "elevated": "rgb(var(--bg-elevated))",
      "hover": "rgb(var(--bg-hover))",
      "primary": "rgb(var(--text-primary))",
      "secondary": "rgb(var(--text-secondary))",
      "muted": "rgb(var(--text-muted))",
      "subtle": "rgb(var(--border-subtle))",
      "default": "rgb(var(--border-default))"
    }
  },
